WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Noura: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22, over.

2
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.100
Sierra 2: Go ahead, over.

3
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.200
Noura: Sierra 2, Marshal 22. North Stand, Block 112 vomitory.

4
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:28.000
Noura: Flare lit near the front, two fans on the barrier, surge forward.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.100
Noura: No injuries seen. Keeping the vomitory clear and watching. Over.

6
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.800
Narrator: Listen to her message.

7
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:41.300
Narrator: Call sign, where, what, who, what she's doing. Facts - no guesses, no opinions.

8
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:45.400
Narrator: Sierra two sends Security. Noura stays on post.
